WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.167
Some strings contain meaningful internal structure.

00:00:03.167 --> 00:00:09.802
An email address has a delimiter between the user portion and domain.

00:00:09.802 --> 00:00:13.507
If the delimiter is reliable, SPLIT_PART can extract pieces based on structure.

00:00:13.507 --> 00:00:18.197
This is usually easier to understand than using fixed character positions,

00:00:18.197 --> 00:00:21.752
which can break when string lengths vary.

00:00:21.752 --> 00:00:29.037
Parsing converts text into a typed value; formatting converts a typed value into presentation text.

00:00:29.037 --> 00:00:35.932
Perform analytical work on typed dates and timestamps, then format near the presentation layer.

00:00:35.932 --> 00:00:42.972
If parsing can fail, validate the incoming pattern first instead of letting one malformed value stop an entire

00:00:42.972 --> 00:00:44.252
load.
